WEBVTT

00:04.420 --> 00:05.420
<b>Oh, Eiji.</b>

00:06.130 --> 00:08.380
<b>Is that all you're bringing?</b>

00:08.800 --> 00:11.340
<b>Guess that's fine. Let us go.</b>

00:13.010 --> 00:13.800
<b>No…</b>

00:13.880 --> 00:15.890
<b>please go ahead.</b>

00:16.390 --> 00:17.180
<b>Huh?</b>

00:20.100 --> 00:21.640
<b>I will follow right behind you.</b>

00:24.190 --> 00:26.100
<b>Ei… ji…</b>

00:48.840 --> 00:50.960
<b>It has to go.</b>

02:28.600 --> 02:30.190
<b>Hey, Dali.</b>

02:30.270 --> 02:31.940
<b>What's going to happen to us?</b>

02:32.690 --> 02:35.440
<b>Why did that woman and Eiji bring us here?</b>

02:35.530 --> 02:36.570
<b>As if I know!</b>

02:38.490 --> 02:42.240
<b>I obviously
don't know what Eiji is thinking.</b>

02:43.490 --> 02:45.410
<b>We're just strangers, after all.</b>

02:48.540 --> 02:49.540
<b>No…</b>

02:50.250 --> 02:51.420
<b>I don't understand.</b>

02:53.210 --> 02:54.880
<b>This family...</b>

02:55.880 --> 02:57.710
<b>Our Ichijo family,</b>

02:57.800 --> 03:00.340
<b>had no problems whatsoever.</b>

03:00.880 --> 03:04.350
<b>It's not a problem that
my brother is being made to wear diapers?</b>

03:04.430 --> 03:05.310
<b>Diapers?</b>

03:05.720 --> 03:07.980
<b>Is Eiji a bed-wetter?</b>

03:10.440 --> 03:12.690
<b>It's because you're like this</b>

03:12.770 --> 03:14.980
<b>that she got as bad as she is.</b>

03:16.820 --> 03:19.780
<b><i>She first made this house</i>
<i>the way she wanted it</i></b>

03:19.860 --> 03:24.450
<b><i>then extended her influence</i>
<i>to the whole village.</i></b>

03:26.490 --> 03:29.040
<b>You had a patient
this close to you all along.</b>

03:31.210 --> 03:34.170
<b>Really, it's an ironic story.</b>

03:39.130 --> 03:40.970
<b>Hey, hey!</b>

03:41.050 --> 03:44.050
<b>The hole's widened a bit.</b>

03:44.140 --> 03:47.140
<b>If I keep gnawing like this…</b>

03:49.430 --> 03:50.520
<b>What's that?</b>

03:51.140 --> 03:52.060
<b>This smell…</b>

03:53.150 --> 03:54.770
<b>It's like something being smoked…</b>

03:55.650 --> 03:58.230
<b>Oh. We're going to be burned alive.</b>

04:02.700 --> 04:04.360
<b>Mama!</b>

04:04.870 --> 04:06.030
<b>Damn it!</b>

04:06.120 --> 04:08.200
<b>They set a fire and ran off!</b>

04:08.620 --> 04:09.950
<b>Move!</b>

04:15.580 --> 04:17.090
<b>Father-in-law!</b>

04:32.730 --> 04:33.730
<b>Maru!</b>

05:03.470 --> 05:04.170
<b>Migi!</b>

05:06.130 --> 05:07.590
<b>Migi! You're bleeding...</b>

05:18.860 --> 05:20.020
<b>Migi!</b>

05:20.110 --> 05:21.570
<b>-That's enough…
-Let go!</b>

05:22.900 --> 05:24.570
<b>We're going back home.</b>

05:26.360 --> 05:29.910
<b>We'll all eat cherry pie together.</b>

05:41.300 --> 05:42.340
<b>Migi…</b>

05:43.670 --> 05:45.090
<b>Migi…!</b>

05:52.720 --> 05:54.810
<b>I can't see well in the dark,</b>

05:54.890 --> 05:56.310
<b>but the wind told me.</b>

05:57.390 --> 06:00.520
<b>A strangely warm breeze blew towards me.</b>

06:04.070 --> 06:05.570
<b>I've come to get you.</b>

06:05.650 --> 06:06.820
<b>Akiyama!</b>

06:09.070 --> 06:10.200
<b>I had no idea</b>

06:10.280 --> 06:12.740
<b>you were locked up in here.</b>

06:13.660 --> 06:15.040
<b>Ah, you're injured.</b>

06:15.120 --> 06:16.830
<b>We'll have to treat that later.</b>

06:17.250 --> 06:18.040
<b>What...</b>

06:18.620 --> 06:20.630
<b>What happened to you?</b>

06:21.540 --> 06:22.920
<b>Well, you know...</b>

06:24.550 --> 06:28.010
<b>I am a disgrace to birds
right now, aren't I?</b>

06:30.180 --> 06:33.220
<b>Anyway, let's escape from this house.</b>

06:34.890 --> 06:38.350
<b>No one wants to
end their life in a birdcage.</b>

07:57.890 --> 08:00.180
<b>Maru!</b>

08:01.100 --> 08:04.190
<b>If you jump,
I'll do something nice for you!</b>

09:00.330 --> 09:01.750
<b>Wait!</b>

09:01.830 --> 09:03.290
<b>Eiji is still inside!</b>

09:03.370 --> 09:04.410
<b>What?</b>

09:05.750 --> 09:07.040
<b>Eiji is…?</b>

09:08.250 --> 09:10.550
<b>He ought to have escaped already.</b>

09:10.630 --> 09:13.760
<b>I saw him through
the gap in the bedroom door.</b>

09:13.840 --> 09:16.340
<b>He was embracing his motionless mother.</b>

09:16.430 --> 09:18.760
<b>Just standing there...</b>

09:20.970 --> 09:24.390
<b>I called out to him, but he didn't hear.</b>

09:25.350 --> 09:27.480
<b>It was… as if...</b>

09:28.060 --> 09:30.270
<b>As if he was trying to die.</b>

09:44.960 --> 09:46.290
<b>This is…</b>

09:47.920 --> 09:49.840
<b>The Song of the Water Flea…</b>

10:04.350 --> 10:05.730
<b>Mother.</b>

10:05.810 --> 10:07.270
<b>Do you remember?</b>

10:08.190 --> 10:10.560
<b>You used to play this song for me</b>

10:10.650 --> 10:12.730
<b>instead of a lullaby.</b>

10:48.100 --> 10:49.190
<b>Eiji...</b>

10:50.940 --> 10:54.440
<b>Why... Why is this happening?!</b>

11:10.750 --> 11:12.920
<b>He is like me.</b>

11:13.000 --> 11:13.790
<b>Dali?</b>

11:14.960 --> 11:17.760
<b>He is like I was when I didn't have you.</b>

11:19.680 --> 11:20.470
<b>Dali!</b>

11:20.880 --> 11:22.550
<b>Dali!</b>

11:31.020 --> 11:32.860
<b>Ah, Mother.</b>

11:32.940 --> 11:34.110
<b>Look at this.</b>

11:35.480 --> 11:37.820
<b>It looks just like the Milky Way.</b>

11:38.570 --> 11:39.990
<b>Do you remember?</b>

11:40.740 --> 11:44.280
<b>When we went
to the planetarium together long ago.</b>

11:51.620 --> 11:55.670
<b><i>That constellation of stars you see</i>
<i>is Pisces.</i></b>

11:56.250 --> 11:58.300
<b><i>According to Greek mythology...</i></b>

11:58.380 --> 12:00.170
<b><i>When I glanced to the side,</i></b>

12:00.260 --> 12:02.220
<b><i>you were asleep.</i></b>

12:05.850 --> 12:09.890
<b><i>You were always perfect and without fault,</i>
<i>so your sleeping face...</i></b>

12:10.640 --> 12:12.770
<b><i>made me strangely happy.</i></b>

12:13.810 --> 12:16.480
<b><i>I kept watching it for a long, long time.</i></b>

12:27.240 --> 12:28.330
<b>Mother…</b>

12:29.200 --> 12:32.790
<b>I wanted to someday
become a doctor like father,</b>

12:32.870 --> 12:35.750
<b>so that I could bring peace to your heart.</b>

12:37.750 --> 12:39.000
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

12:40.340 --> 12:43.430
<b>This is the only way
I could give you peace.</b>

12:45.300 --> 12:47.970
<b>In your eyes, was I</b>

12:48.060 --> 12:51.180
<b>the perfect son until the end?</b>

12:57.190 --> 12:59.110
<b>If so, that's good.</b>

13:10.120 --> 13:11.120
<b><i>Mother…</i></b>

13:12.040 --> 13:14.710
<b><i>No matter what anyone says,</i></b>

13:14.790 --> 13:18.250
<b><i>you were the perfect mother to me.</i></b>

13:18.750 --> 13:20.170
<b><i>That's why I also</i></b>

13:20.250 --> 13:22.460
<b><i>wanted to be perfect at all times.</i></b>

13:23.220 --> 13:25.430
<b><i>The fact that I fulfilled that</i></b>

13:26.550 --> 13:27.890
<b><i>is truly</i></b>

13:27.970 --> 13:29.810
<b><i>something I am proud of.</i></b>

13:32.600 --> 13:33.680
<b>I'm sure...</b>

13:40.980 --> 13:43.440
<b>you would've praised me for it too, right?</b>

13:45.740 --> 13:47.610
<b>Was bed-wetting included in that story?</b>

13:58.540 --> 14:00.040
<b>Why are you here?</b>

14:01.550 --> 14:02.750
<b>Never mind.</b>

14:03.420 --> 14:05.010
<b>Please leave.</b>

14:05.090 --> 14:06.130
<b>Don't get in the way.</b>

14:07.300 --> 14:09.090
<b>I came for revenge.</b>

14:12.060 --> 14:13.640
<b>I hated you</b>

14:13.720 --> 14:15.680
<b>because you killed our mother.</b>

14:16.480 --> 14:18.060
<b>Or so I thought.</b>

14:19.190 --> 14:20.520
<b>But the real reason is</b>

14:21.690 --> 14:22.730
<b>because you and I</b>

14:23.480 --> 14:24.860
<b>are alike.</b>

14:28.110 --> 14:30.120
<b>Familial hatred, huh.</b>

14:30.410 --> 14:32.910
<b>It's a little late for you
to pick the family act.</b>

14:34.450 --> 14:36.080
<b>Just kill me already.</b>

14:36.540 --> 14:38.370
<b>You came for revenge, right?</b>

14:39.000 --> 14:40.960
<b>There's a knife over there.</b>

14:41.420 --> 14:43.420
<b>With that, I die</b>

14:43.500 --> 14:45.550
<b>and you achieve your revenge.</b>

14:46.050 --> 14:47.720
<b>Two birds with one stone.</b>

14:49.010 --> 14:50.760
<b>My revenge is</b>

14:51.470 --> 14:52.390
<b>to make you…</b>

14:53.010 --> 14:54.010
<b>Dali!</b>

14:56.100 --> 14:57.140
<b>You're here.</b>

14:57.230 --> 14:58.100
<b>Dali!</b>

14:58.190 --> 15:00.690
<b>Why return after you've escaped?</b>

15:00.770 --> 15:02.730
<b>Do you want to be burnt up?</b>

15:02.810 --> 15:04.360
<b>Hey, Migi…</b>

15:04.440 --> 15:05.610
<b>I might ask</b>

15:05.690 --> 15:07.610
<b>you the same question.</b>

15:08.320 --> 15:09.320
<b>Huh?</b>

15:16.250 --> 15:17.750
<b>No way!</b>

15:17.830 --> 15:19.120
<b>Shut up, get out!</b>

15:20.420 --> 15:23.090
<b>You can't die beautifully this way, hm?</b>

15:24.290 --> 15:28.420
<b>I too have had my plans
ruined by him over and over.</b>

15:29.260 --> 15:32.050
<b>You'll give up on yours soon enough too.</b>

15:36.810 --> 15:38.560
<b>Live disgracefully.</b>

15:42.310 --> 15:43.190
<b>This is</b>

15:43.360 --> 15:45.070
<b>my revenge.</b>

15:45.900 --> 15:46.780
<b>Let's go!</b>

15:47.280 --> 15:48.070
<b>Hey!</b>

15:48.150 --> 15:49.570
<b>Let go, hey!</b>

15:49.900 --> 15:51.320
<b>Hey!</b>

15:53.700 --> 15:55.450
<b>Don't interfere!</b>

16:04.040 --> 16:04.920
<b>Dali!</b>

16:13.890 --> 16:15.680
<b>Dali! Dali!</b>

16:19.390 --> 16:20.770
<b>Dali…</b>

16:20.850 --> 16:21.940
<b>Where…</b>

16:29.360 --> 16:30.690
<b>That was close…</b>

16:40.160 --> 16:41.330
<b>It's no good...</b>

16:41.790 --> 16:43.460
<b>I can't see anything.</b>

16:50.710 --> 16:52.510
<b>Mother…?</b>

16:53.380 --> 16:55.970
<b>Have you come… to get me…?</b>

17:09.980 --> 17:11.690
<b>Mic… chan?</b>

17:14.400 --> 17:15.200
<b>Dali!</b>

17:15.610 --> 17:17.660
<b>Dali! Hang in there!</b>

17:19.160 --> 17:20.370
<b>Thank goodness.</b>

17:20.450 --> 17:21.700
<b>Come on, let's get out…</b>

17:21.790 --> 17:22.660
<b>Where's Eiji…?</b>

17:42.560 --> 17:43.730
<b>Eiji!</b>

17:44.850 --> 17:46.810
<b>Hey… hey…</b>

17:47.400 --> 17:48.190
<b>Eiji.</b>

17:50.610 --> 17:51.690
<b>Eiji!</b>

17:52.030 --> 17:54.320
<b>Wake up! Hey!</b>

17:54.860 --> 17:55.950
<b>Hey!</b>

17:56.410 --> 17:59.320
<b>Dali... We have to go.</b>

17:59.410 --> 18:01.790
<b>If we stay, we'll end up the same way...</b>

18:03.790 --> 18:05.160
<b>Dali…?</b>

18:11.420 --> 18:12.300
<b>Dali.</b>

18:26.440 --> 18:27.690
<b>Geez.</b>

18:29.190 --> 18:31.570
<b>You're a pretty troublesome brother.</b>

18:32.770 --> 18:35.530
<b>Never thought I'd be told off by you.</b>

18:39.110 --> 18:41.160
<b>Ready… now!</b>

18:46.790 --> 18:49.790
<b>Just a… little more…</b>

18:50.330 --> 18:51.210
<b>What are you doing?</b>

18:54.510 --> 18:57.420
<b>Just… leave me alone.</b>

18:57.930 --> 18:59.550
<b>You only want to keep me alive</b>

18:59.640 --> 19:01.600
<b>for your amusement, don't you?</b>

19:02.140 --> 19:05.220
<b>To laugh at me,
now that I'm not perfect anymore…</b>

19:06.520 --> 19:08.310
<b>Yeah, that's right.</b>

19:08.390 --> 19:09.440
<b>Eiji.</b>

19:10.060 --> 19:11.520
<b>After this, you...</b>

19:13.230 --> 19:15.070
<b>Will go home with us</b>

19:15.150 --> 19:16.990
<b>to eat cherry pie.</b>

19:18.900 --> 19:20.450
<b>Hey, Eiji!</b>

19:20.530 --> 19:23.950
<b>Don't hog the pie
just because you're hungry!</b>

19:24.700 --> 19:27.580
<b>Don't end up with a red mouth like Migi.</b>

19:28.000 --> 19:31.330
<b>We'll all dive in
and create a cherry pie tragedy!</b>

20:00.450 --> 20:01.990
<b>Are you serious?</b>

20:03.410 --> 20:05.950
<b>That wouldn't suit me at all.</b>

20:29.850 --> 20:31.020
<b>There's no way...</b>

20:31.100 --> 20:33.150
<b>-The Ichijo family?
-How?</b>

20:33.230 --> 20:34.520
<b>Reiko! Reiko!</b>

20:34.610 --> 20:35.810
<b>Reiko!</b>

20:35.900 --> 20:38.820
<b>A body, possibly female,
was found in the bedroom.</b>

20:39.360 --> 20:40.650
<b>No way.</b>

20:41.200 --> 20:43.240
<b>Migi... Dali…</b>

20:43.530 --> 20:45.070
<b>Those guys…</b>

20:47.780 --> 20:48.740
<b>What do we do?</b>

20:49.790 --> 20:52.330
<b>We have to tell them we're alive.</b>

20:52.410 --> 20:54.960
<b>No, it's not a good idea to come out now.</b>

20:55.080 --> 20:56.960
<b>Let's go back home for now.</b>

20:59.460 --> 21:01.510
<b>Don't worry, Eiji.</b>

21:01.590 --> 21:04.220
<b>Our parents will hide us.</b>

21:04.890 --> 21:07.760
<b>The cherry pie at our house
is exceptionally sweet.</b>

21:10.430 --> 21:11.560
<b>Eiji?</b>

21:13.140 --> 21:14.650
<b>That pie</b>

21:14.730 --> 21:17.020
<b>is too sweet for me.</b>

21:18.230 --> 21:19.020
<b>Huh?</b>

21:20.440 --> 21:23.610
<b>We're actively searching for your son.</b>

21:27.910 --> 21:29.030
<b>Eiji!</b>

21:29.120 --> 21:31.830
<b>Thank goodness. Thank the Lord.</b>

21:31.910 --> 21:33.500
<b>Really!</b>

21:33.580 --> 21:36.380
<b>Eiji, I was so worried about you...</b>

21:38.340 --> 21:39.840
<b>The murder of my mother,</b>

21:40.670 --> 21:42.460
<b>and the arson of the house,</b>

21:43.630 --> 21:45.930
<b>the killing of Ms. Mitsuyama...</b>

21:49.350 --> 21:52.220
<b>I did it all.</b>

23:37.450 --> 23:38.460
<b>Eiji…</b>
